{"seq":1,"slug":"multicurrency-position-netting","title":"多币种头寸与双边/多边净额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/multicurrency-position-netting","wordCount":1871,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种头寸与双边-多边净额\">多币种头寸与双边/多边净额</h1><p>资金池建好之后，每天真正要回答的问题只有一个：<strong>集团此刻有多少钱、缺多少钱、在哪个币种</strong>。这个答案叫头寸（position）。多币种环境下，头寸不是一个数字而是一个矩阵——币种 × 主体 × 时点。而净额（netting）是把矩阵压缩成可执行动作的技术：把内部应收应付轧掉，只留对外的真实敞口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>头寸分两层。<strong>账面头寸</strong>是各主体在各币种账户上的实际余额，它随时可见；<strong>可用头寸</strong>要扣掉在途、预留、受限与最低留存，才是真正能动用的资金。两者之差常被低估——账面显示有钱但当天付不出去，多数事故源于此。</p>\n<p>净额结算也分两层。<strong>双边净额</strong>只在两个主体之间轧账，A 欠 B 的减去 B 欠 A 的，剩余部分结算；<strong>多边净额</strong>在所有参与主体之间做全局轧差，每个主体只对净头寸负责，且每个主体最多付一笔、收一笔。多边净额的资金效率显著高于双边，但它要求一个中心对手方或一套多边协议来承担清算责任。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[A欠B 100] --&gt; N{净额模式}&#10;    B2[B欠A 60] --&gt; N&#10;    N --&gt;|双边| D1[A付B 40]&#10;    N --&gt;|多边| D2[中心轧差]&#10;    D2 --&gt; D3[A净付 40 给池]&#10;    D2 --&gt; D4[C净收 25 从池]&#10;    D3 --&gt; R[仅净头寸参与实际支付]&#10;    D4 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    A[A欠B 100] --&gt; N{净额模式}\n    B2[B欠A 60] --&gt; N\n    N --&gt;|双边| D1[A付B 40]\n    N --&gt;|多边| D2[中心轧差]\n    D2 --&gt; D3[A净付 40 给池]\n    D2 --&gt; D4[C净收 25 从池]\n    D3 --&gt; R[仅净头寸参与实际支付]\n    D4 --&gt; R</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>双边净额</th>\n<th>多边净额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轧差对象</td>\n<td>两两之间</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算笔数</td>\n<td>最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要中心方</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（或协议）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对手方风险</td>\n<td>分散在各主体</td>\n<td>集中于中心方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>主体少、关系简单</td>\n<td>主体多、往来密集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多币种头寸的构成与度量\">多币种头寸的构成与度量</h2><h3 id=\"三层头寸口径\">三层头寸口径</h3><p>工程上必须把三个数字分开，否则任何一次资金调度都会变成对账事故：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账面余额</td>\n<td>账户实时余额</td>\n<td>银行对账基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用余额</td>\n<td>账面 − 在途 − 预留 − 受限 − 最低留存</td>\n<td>当日可调度资金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测余额</td>\n<td>可用余额 + 当日确定收付 + 期间预测现金流</td>\n<td>决策依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在途资金是最容易被忽略的一层。一笔已发出但未到账的付款在两边的账面上都还显示为可用，直到清算完成。跨时区、跨币种、跨清算系统的资金，在途窗口可以是数小时到数天，这段窗口里的头寸判断必须显式建模。</p>\n<h3 id=\"头寸聚合的币种处理\">头寸聚合的币种处理</h3><p>多币种头寸不能简单相加。当日元敞口和欧元敞口同时存在时，要么按币种分别管理（保留各币种独立头寸），要么折算成集团功能货币（承担折算风险）。折算率的选择本身就是决策——用即期汇率、用预算汇率还是用加权平均汇率，得出的&quot;集团净头寸&quot;完全不同。会计上，功能性货币的定义是&quot;主体经营所处的主要经济环境中的货币&quot;，也就是它<strong>主要产生和支出现金</strong>的环境；其他货币都是外币（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-21-the-effects-of-changes-in-foreign-exchange-rates/\">IFRS Foundation 对 IAS 21 的说明</a>）。这一定义决定了折算基线：不是管理者偏好哪个币种，而是该主体实际以哪个币种经营。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH balance AS (&#10;  SELECT entity, currency,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN bucket = &#39;book&#39;      THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS book_balance,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN bucket = &#39;in_transit&#39; THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS in_transit,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN bucket = &#39;reserved&#39;  THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS reserved,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN bucket = &#39;restricted&#39; THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS restricted,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN bucket = &#39;min_keep&#39;  THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS min_keep&#10;  FROM treasury_account_position&#10;  WHERE as_of = TIMESTAMP &#39;2026-09-28 18:00:00&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY entity, currency&#10;)&#10;SELECT entity, currency, book_balance,&#10;       book_balance - in_transit - reserved - restricted - min_keep AS available_balance,&#10;       ROUND((book_balance - in_transit - reserved - restricted - min_keep)&#10;             * fx_rate.rate, 2) AS available_in_group_ccy&#10;FROM balance&#10;JOIN fx_rate USING (currency)&#10;WHERE fx_rate.as_of = DATE &#39;2026-09-28&#39;&#10;ORDER BY available_in_group_ccy DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'book'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> book_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reserved'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'restricted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'min_keep'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_keep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treasury_account_position</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> as_of </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-28 18:00:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, currency, book_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       book_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_keep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((book_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_keep)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_in_group_ccy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fx_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (currency)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">as_of</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-28'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_in_group_ccy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询把三个口径在一张表里对齐，<code>available_in_group_ccy</code> 就是集团层面的可调度资金。它是头寸看板的核心输出，也是后续短期投资与流动性预测的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"净额结算的执行机制\">净额结算的执行机制</h2><h3 id=\"轧差的计算形式\">轧差的计算形式</h3><p>设成员 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 对成员 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的应付为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则成员 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的多边净头寸为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>net</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>j</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net}_i = \\sum_j p_{ji} - \\sum*j p*{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mtext>net</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\text{net}_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时（内部往来完全闭合），净额结算无需任何外部资金即可完成全部清偿。这正是多边净额最大的价值：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的支付需求压缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且在大多数周期里<strong>总外部资金需求为零</strong>。只有当引入外部对手方或存在跨币种时，才需要真实资金过桥。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨币种净额的额外约束\">跨币种净额的额外约束</h3><p>多币种净额比单币种复杂得多，因为不同币种的净头寸不能直接相抵——除非先做一次换汇。这就产生一个选择：<strong>分币种独立净额</strong>（各币种各自轧差，保留各币种敞口）还是<strong>折算后净额</strong>（先换汇再轧差，引入换汇成本与汇率风险）。</p>\n<p>工程上的可靠做法是分币种独立净额，把跨币种的合并交给专门的外汇交易环节处理，而不是塞进净额引擎。理由有二：一是换汇有成本与价差，把它藏进净额会让结算金额不可解释；二是汇率在选择结算时点与执行时点之间会变，混在净额里会让&quot;谁承担汇率损失&quot;变得无法追溯。跨币种敞口的对冲见<a href=\"../treasury-risk-metric/fx-exposure-hedge-policy\">资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结算时点与最终性\">结算时点与最终性</h3><p>净额结算的时点选择直接影响资金效率与风险。常见的有日终轧差（用当日全部交易）、定期轧差（如每自然月一次，这是跨境资金池的监管下限，见<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>）和连续净额。时点越频繁，需要的过桥资金越少，但运营成本与失败重试的复杂度越高。</p>\n<p>最终性（finality）是另一个必须明确的概念：净额后的支付一旦完成清算，是否不可撤销？在净额结算中，如果参与方在结算窗口内违约，已完成的净额支付可能被回滚，导致其他参与方暴露。这一风险的处理方式通常是要求参与方提供担保或设定净额上限——这属于<a href=\"../treasury-risk-metric/liquidity-risk-contingency\">流动性风险与应急额度</a>的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"头寸管理的运营节奏\">头寸管理的运营节奏</h2><p>头寸不是一天看一次的数字，它有一条日内的节奏线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开盘前</td>\n<td>汇总隔夜余额 + 当日到期</td>\n<td>确定起始可用头寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上午</td>\n<td>接收并核验当日收付指令</td>\n<td>修正预测头寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>午间</td>\n<td>确定当日融资/投资规模</td>\n<td>隔夜资金安排截止前锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截止前</td>\n<td>执行归集与净额结算</td>\n<td>银行清算窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收盘后</td>\n<td>回写实际头寸 + 差异分析</td>\n<td>预测与实际的偏差归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个节奏决定了资金池系统必须支持<strong>日内多次重算头寸</strong>，而不是日终批处理一次。预测与实际的偏差分析是<a href=\"cash-flow-forecast-visibility\">跨主体现金流预测与可视性</a>的输入，偏差的持续性会反馈到预测模型的参数上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>头寸有三层口径：账面、可用、预测；混淆三者是资金调度事故的主要来源。</li>\n<li>在途资金在跨时区跨币种场景下的窗口可达数小时到数天，必须显式建模。</li>\n<li>多币种头寸的折算基线由功能性货币定义决定，而非管理者偏好。</li>\n<li>多边净额把支付笔数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且内部往来闭合时<strong>总外部资金需求为零</strong>。</li>\n<li>跨币种净额应分币种独立轧差，换汇交给专门的外汇环节，避免结算金额与汇率损失不可解释。</li>\n<li>净额结算的时点频率与最终性安排决定了需要多少过桥资金与担保。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种头寸与双边/多边净额","id":"多币种头寸与双边-多边净额"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种头寸的构成与度量","id":"多币种头寸的构成与度量"},{"level":3,"text":"三层头寸口径","id":"三层头寸口径"},{"level":3,"text":"头寸聚合的币种处理","id":"头寸聚合的币种处理"},{"level":2,"text":"净额结算的执行机制","id":"净额结算的执行机制"},{"level":3,"text":"轧差的计算形式","id":"轧差的计算形式"},{"level":3,"text":"跨币种净额的额外约束","id":"跨币种净额的额外约束"},{"level":3,"text":"结算时点与最终性","id":"结算时点与最终性"},{"level":2,"text":"头寸管理的运营节奏","id":"头寸管理的运营节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内部银行与收付款工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/inhouse-bank-payment-factory"},"next":{"title":"跨主体现金流预测与可视性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/cash-flow-forecast-visibility"}}